		<p>To open the glove box, pull the handle and the glove box will automatically open.</p>
		<p>Close the glove box after use.</p>
		<note type="warning" id="e02176">
			<p>Glove box</p>
			<p>To reduce the risk of injury in an accident or sudden stop, always keep the glove box door closed while driving.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="caution" id="e02177">
			<p>Do not keep food in the glove box for an extended period of time.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="tip" id="e02178">
			<p>If the temperature control switch is in the warm or hot position, warm or hot air will flow into the glove box.</p>
		</note>
